    - Code: en
      Text: 'We use your device''s advertising ID and gameplay data to show ads that
        suit you and to make the game better. You can refuse: you will still see
        ads, just not personalised ones.'
    - Code: tr
      Text: "Sana uygun reklamlar g\xF6stermek ve oyunu geli\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in
        cihaz\u0131n\u0131n reklam kimli\u011Fini ve oyun verilerini kullan\u0131yoruz.
        Reddedebilirsin: reklamlar yine g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr, yaln\u0131zca sana \xF6zel
        olmaz."
